"""Cold Fold engine v7.1.0 -- single-file edition for Pyto (iPhone/iPad).

Open this file in Pyto and tap Run. No installation needed: the whole
cold_fold_engine package is bundled inside this file.

It runs, in order:
  1. the full plate pipeline (organism run) -- seals at HA-8 Apex
  2. the stepped runtime with the default perturbation schedule
  3. each cycle (relativistic, collapse, demo)
  4. a self-check: the trace digest must match the published value

Author: James Stanley. License: MIT.
"""
